  text:
    An Antivirus will walk you through the Tube to the Internet for a reinstallation. Your buttons are off until you are reinstalled. Bathroom Mode still works: the Antivirus wait outside.
    - Escorted to the Internet, done when program.corrupted == true
  buttons: pass

